Description: active and offline JSON Web Token security auditor
 jwt-audit discovers protected HTTP endpoints and checks whether they accept
 unsigned JWTs or tokens signed with weak HMAC candidate secrets. It also
 provides offline token inspection, configurable scan profiles, evidence
 confirmation, and JSON, text, and SARIF reports.
